## Results

WasteWise AI was developed as an AI-powered waste management solution aimed at promoting proper waste segregation and encouraging sustainable waste disposal practices.

The system demonstrates how Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning can contribute to smarter waste management by identifying different categories of waste and supporting appropriate segregation decisions.

### Key Results

- **Waste Classification:** Implements an intelligent approach to classify waste into relevant categories based on the input provided to the system.
- **Automated Identification:** Uses AI-based techniques to reduce dependence on manual waste identification.
- **Waste Segregation Support:** Helps users understand the appropriate category for different waste materials.
- **User-Friendly Interface:** Provides an accessible interface for interacting with the waste management system.
- **Environmental Awareness:** Encourages responsible waste disposal and promotes recycling practices.
- **Smart Waste Management:** Demonstrates the potential of AI in improving waste classification and segregation processes.

### Outcome

The project demonstrates the practical application of Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning in addressing environmental challenges.

WasteWise AI provides a foundation for an intelligent waste management system that can assist users in identifying waste categories and making better disposal decisions. It highlights the role of technology in supporting recycling, reducing improper waste disposal, and promoting environmental sustainability.

The system can be further enhanced through real-time image recognition, smart dustbin integration, waste collection optimization, and location-based recycling facility recommendations.
